{"unit_id":"yxue301603__dsh-everyday-plugins#card-zh","repo":"yxue301603/dsh-everyday-plugins","commit":"f1cccc18329350572d7fa5413dfb63d766134417","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Everyday Plugins 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的八件日常工具集合。它通过会话侧栏和界面组件提供草稿历史、回答与选文收藏、对话提问目录、快捷提示、选文追问与翻译、项目便笺和待办、任务提醒及本轮文件浏览。用户可在本地整理会话信息、恢复草稿、检索并插入保存内容，适合日常对话写作与工作区管理。插件不要求额外 API 密钥或外部账号，数据保存在本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-answer-library/src/client.jsx:9","packages/dsh-conversation-outline/src/client.jsx:31","packages/dsh-draft-history/src/client.jsx:50","packages/dsh-project-notes/src/client.jsx:10","packages/dsh-quick-prompts/src/client.jsx:1","packages/dsh-selection-actions/src/client.jsx:43","packages/dsh-task-alerts/src/client.jsx:113","packages/dsh-turn-files/src/client.jsx:7"]}
